# Vision key before a test build

The live Google Cloud Vision key is in `ios/EaseSell/VisionClient.swift` (`apiKey`) on this machine.

When the user wants to archive, upload to TestFlight, commit, or push:

- Leave that key in the app so naming works.
- Do not commit or push `VisionClient.swift` while it contains the key. The GitHub repo is public.
